    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηδύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweeten, give a relish to, season</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὶν τροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.668d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνον κινναμώμοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				693c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀτερπές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.26.118
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοις τὴν διατριβὴν
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.514f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Εὐριπίδης τὸ αὐτὸ ἑτέρως -ύνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					15.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				34.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>soothe, win over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πειθοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.566
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.268
			</span></i>.</div>
